• Linux: make sure your user can read /dev/video* (often the “video” group)</string>
    <string name="body_no_camera">Plug in a webcam or pick another device, then refresh.
• Mac / Windows: also check the OS camera privacy toggle
• Linux: confirm a V4L2 device exists (`ls /dev/video*`)</string>
